Subject: [PATCH] Prioritize Lua-bound image prefetch over chapter supplements

---
 core/src/runtime/surface_loader.rs | 137 +++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 120 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/src/runtime/surface_loader.rs b/core/src/runtime/surface_loader.rs
index 5a18b1d..97e552a 100644
